{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44891","headline":"奉和段着作山居呈诸同志三首次本韵 二 · 无可","name":"奉和段着作山居呈诸同志三首次本韵 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官辞中秘府，疎放野麋齐。\n偃仰青霄近，登临白日低。\n折腰窥乳窦，定足涉冰溪。\n染翰挥岚翠，僧名几处题。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无可","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44891.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44891","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}